{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SQ9ySmVrtXR3pQ3zC4KZoa","type":"tool_result","content":"/tmp/gh-aw/agent/issues_index.json\nFAQ.md:3:- [Extra space, not enough space, in Jupyter output](#extra-space-not-enough-space-in-jupyter-output)\nFAQ.md:14:<a name=\"extra-space-not-enough-space-in-jupyter-output\"></a>\nFAQ.md:15:## Extra space, not enough space, in Jupyter output\nFAQ.md:17:There are many different implementations of Jupyter, from different vendors.\nFAQ.md:22:I have been adding and removing new lines for jupyter since Rich added support, and I am reluctant to continue to do that, *unless* there is some supporting evidence that Rich is doing the wrong thing.\nFAQ.md:26:I will accept PRs, if sufficient research has been done regarding not breaking other Jupyter implementations (but that is a high bar).\nquestions/jupyter.question.md:2:title: \"Extra space, not enough space, in Jupyter output\"\nquestions/jupyter.question.md:4:  - \"Extra new line in Jupyter\"\nquestions/jupyter.question.md:5:  - \"Not enough space in Jupyter\"\nquestions/jupyter.question.md:8:There are many different implementations of Jupyter, from different vendors.\nquestions/jupyter.question.md:13:I have been adding and removing new lines for jupyter since Rich added support, and I am reluctant to continue to do that, *unless* there is some supporting evidence that Rich is doing the wrong thing.\nquestions/jupyter.question.md:17:I will accept PRs, if sufficient research has been done regarding not breaking other Jupyter implementations (but that is a high bar).","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"02877f4f-ce1d-4b36-9d84-b279a63f24e5","uuid":"9d9af3b3-1c28-4c7d-9beb-5196d07983e5","timestamp":"2026-10-26T10:17:20.357Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"/tmp/gh-aw/agent/issues_index.json\nFAQ.md:3:- [Extra space, not enough space, in Jupyter output](#extra-space-not-enough-space-in-jupyter-output)\nFAQ.md:14:<a name=\"extra-space-